OL,3,GNEWSAParts of M18 closed in both
OL,4,Adirections after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on the M18
OL,7,Fnear Doncaster following a collision,
OL,8,Fpolice and National Highways have said.
OL,10,FClosures are in place between junctions
OL,11,Fthree and five on the northbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway and junctions four and five
OL,13,Fon the southbound carriageway, near
OL,14,FThorne.
OL,16,FNational Highways said the road was
OL,17,F"likely to remain closed all morning"
OL,18,Ffollowing a "serious collision"
OL,19,Fearlier, while South Yorkshire Police
OL,20,Fhave urged motorists to avoid the area
OL,21,Fwhere possible.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
